uct. . . .}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025  }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 [E]}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 very imitative phenomenon must once have had its original, and I propose that for the future we keep as close as may be to the more first-hand and original forms of experience. These are more likely to be found in sporadic adult cases.}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \uc1 \u8221 ? Hence, his study of religion confines itself almost exclusively to incidents in the lives of particular individuals who underwent a private religious experience:}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \sl312 \slmult1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \li420 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin420 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 Religion, therefore, as I now ask you arbitrarily to take it, shall mean for us }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \cs17 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af3 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 the feelings, acts, and experiences of individual men in their solitude, so far as they apprehend themselves to stand in relation to whatever they may consider the divine}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 .}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \sl312 \slmult1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 One should note here that this definition of religion does not stipulate any particular way in which the psychic experience should describe itself. It might be interpreted in an orthodox Christian manner, or with some }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 m\uc1 \u233 ?lange}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025  of eastern and western religions (as in many mind-cure or New Thought therapies), or as a spiritual experience without any immediate connection to a recognized system of belief:}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \sl312 \slmult1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \fi2760 \cufi1150 \li420 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin420 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 And I have felt}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \li420 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin420 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang41